  "verification_confidence": "high",
  "base_medium": "0.6 M Na+ soda buffer (pH 9.8) haloalkaliphilic mineral medium + Pfennig/Lippert (SL-4) trace elements; autotrophic (CO2/bicarbonate fixed via RuBisCO)",
